# Put your server's address here (from Slack), then send each request.
@base = http://your-server-address/api

### 1. A random joke
GET {{base}}/random

### 2. Joke number 3
GET {{base}}/jokes/3

### 3. Only the Puns
GET {{base}}/filter?type=Puns

### 4. Add a joke
POST {{base}}/jokes
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=Why do Java developers wear glasses? Because they don't C#.&type=Programming

### 5. Get the joke you just added (change 13 to the id it got)
GET {{base}}/jokes/13
